    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/7619a9fc070a2f2a93102c5b576b7217.avif?t=1754939323\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A chaotic, physics-based brawling adventure that you probably won\u2019t survive unscathed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of John Builder, the human wrecking ball. Elon Fusk\u2019s construction robots have completely gone rogue, and you are the last hope for the construction site\u2026 and maybe for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your fists, smash robots, break walls, and grab a refreshing coffee in between. Sounds easy? Think again. Every punch, every jump is a physics-based adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/a03da485d7f66c524f6061a983b4a595.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/a03da485d7f66c524f6061a983b4a595.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based brawls</strong> \u2013 swing your fists like a real construction worker (after too much coffee).<br>Every hit feels heavy and unpredictable, chaos guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/b67ad57567b124638699a75ebe5a75d6.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/b67ad57567b124638699a75ebe5a75d6.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of enemies</strong> \u2013 they all want to crush you.<br>From drones to demolition bots, they come in waves, and they all hate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/ee73ca88eeb1fb4a5faa87eefbb6f4d1.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/ee73ca88eeb1fb4a5faa87eefbb6f4d1.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable abilities</strong> \u2013 get stronger, faster, and even more chaotic.<br>Upgrade your fists, sprint like a maniac, or unleash devastating special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/5e8f869128c8bbc552a9b72b9c143d74.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/5e8f869128c8bbc552a9b72b9c143d74.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just another day on the world\u2019s most dangerous construction site.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So, back to work!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/7619a9fc070a2f2a93102c5b576b7217.avif?t=1754939323\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A chaotic, physics-based brawling adventure that you probably won\u2019t survive unscathed.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of John Builder, the human wrecking ball. Elon Fusk\u2019s construction robots have completely gone rogue, and you are the last hope for the construction site\u2026 and maybe for humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing your fists, smash robots, break walls, and grab a refreshing coffee in between. Sounds easy? Think again. Every punch, every jump is a physics-based adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/a03da485d7f66c524f6061a983b4a595.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/a03da485d7f66c524f6061a983b4a595.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-based brawls</strong> \u2013 swing your fists like a real construction worker (after too much coffee).<br>Every hit feels heavy and unpredictable, chaos guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/b67ad57567b124638699a75ebe5a75d6.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/b67ad57567b124638699a75ebe5a75d6.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Variety of enemies</strong> \u2013 they all want to crush you.<br>From drones to demolition bots, they come in waves, and they all hate you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/ee73ca88eeb1fb4a5faa87eefbb6f4d1.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/ee73ca88eeb1fb4a5faa87eefbb6f4d1.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlockable abilities</strong> \u2013 get stronger, faster, and even more chaotic.<br>Upgrade your fists, sprint like a maniac, or unleash devastating special moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/5e8f869128c8bbc552a9b72b9c143d74.poster.avif?t=1754939323\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672440/extras/5e8f869128c8bbc552a9b72b9c143d74.webm?t=1754939323\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Just another day on the world\u2019s most dangerous construction site.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>So, back to work!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
